#     (17 %), M10K 62, DSP 36, UMD_scaffold_20260923_0328.rbf, first roll. The scaffold
#     alone: framework 6.4K ALM, emu 833 (xmb_wave 232, hps_io 391, block_streamer 101,
#     sync_gen 30, dec_stub 12). The three tint multiplies took 3 DSPs; 33 are ascal's.
